r County","/arc-plc/oklahoma/carter-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the middle of Carter County&rsquo;s 10 grids came in under 90% of normal for November to December in 38 of the 75 years from 1951 to 2025. In 2025 the middle of the grids ran 242% of normal for March to April and 48% of normal for November to December. Every grid on the page had its driest year in 1963, and grid 16932 got 47% of normal that year.</p>"}
